<p class="font_8" style="font-size:18px; text-align:justify;"><span class="wixGuard">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8" style="font-size:18px; text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-family:open sans,sans-serif;">This two day event will include demos, networking and expert panels and discussions about the most crucial commercial developments and technical innovations in the field of&nbsp;<span style="font-weight:bold;">FinTech</span> and&nbsp;<span style="font-weight:bold;">Bl</span></span></span><span style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-family:open sans,sans-serif;"><span style="font-weight:bold;">0</span></span></span><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-family:open sans,sans-serif;"><span style="font-weight:bold;">ckchain</span>. </span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8" style="font-size:18px; text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p>

